<title>HONG KONG: First Pacific interim net falls.</title>
<headline>First Pacific interim net falls.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   3.91 vs 6.60</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)    1.16 vs 0.96</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil vs 57.2 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    90.8 vs 129.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,175.5 vs 2,196.1 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Company name		 First Pacific Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 23-24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 11</p>
<p>NOTE - First Pacific is an investment and management firm. It was included on Hong Kong's blue chip Hang Seng Index with effect from August 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
